1
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,699
When Mikel Arteta was asked,

2
00:00:07,749 --> 00:00:11,476
after an Arsenal friendly in
Girona at the start of August,

3
00:00:11,526 --> 00:00:13,336
when Vinicius was coming,

4
00:00:13,386 --> 00:00:14,350
he smiled,

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,492
said thank you and walked out,

6
00:00:16,542 --> 00:00:21,678
and anyone watching assumed it was just another
manager dodging a transfer question.

7
00:00:22,028 --> 00:00:24,967
But according to the Spanish newspaper AS,

8
00:00:25,017 --> 00:00:28,315
it was Arteta himself who was
leading the talks,

9
00:00:28,365 --> 00:00:32,560
promising to make Vinicius the
centre of the English champions,

10
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:35,490
a team where even the wingers track back.

11
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,342
Five days later,

12
00:00:37,392 --> 00:00:41,417
Vinicius signed a new deal with
Real Madrid until 2032,

13
00:00:41,467 --> 00:00:44,910
and it looked as if the
story had ended there.

14
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,107
It came back in October,

15
00:00:47,157 --> 00:00:50,367
when he pulled the hair of a
Villarreal player,

16
00:00:50,417 --> 00:00:55,821
was handed a four-game ban and watched from the
outside as Real Madrid won all four,

17
00:00:55,871 --> 00:00:58,548
including the Clásico at the Camp Nou,

18
00:00:58,598 --> 00:01:03,942
with a nineteen-year-old playing in his
position and doing exactly what Xabi Alonso

19
00:01:03,992 --> 00:01:07,914
had demanded from Vinicius a few
days before he was sacked.

20
00:01:20,664 --> 00:01:22,138
In less than a year,

21
00:01:22,188 --> 00:01:25,950
Vinicius had two chances to become a
different kind of player,

22
00:01:25,1000 --> 00:01:30,632
one with the coach who tried to change him
inside Real Madrid and one with the

23
00:01:30,682 --> 00:01:33,681
coach who offered him a whole
new club to do it,

24
00:01:33,731 --> 00:01:38,254
and both times he chose to stay where he
was, playing the way he always had.

25
00:01:38,604 --> 00:01:39,150
Now,

26
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,540
with the ban served,

27
00:01:40,590 --> 00:01:45,010
he is back in a Real Madrid side that has just
spent a whole month winning without

28
00:01:45,060 --> 00:01:45,606
him,

29
00:01:45,656 --> 00:01:47,692
and to understand how we got here,

30
00:01:47,742 --> 00:01:50,026
we have to go back to May of last year.

31
00:01:54,976 --> 00:01:57,667
Before we go back to the
start of this story,

32
00:01:57,717 --> 00:01:59,942
if you enjoy this kind of breakdown,

33
00:01:59,992 --> 00:02:00,821
hit like,

34
00:02:00,871 --> 00:02:02,528
subscribe to the channel,

35
00:02:02,578 --> 00:02:06,975
and send this video to that Madrid fan who
still thinks the club's problem has

36
00:02:07,025 --> 00:02:08,630
always been the manager.

37
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:12,485
In May 2025,

38
00:02:12,535 --> 00:02:15,603
when Xabi Alonso was
unveiled at the Bernabéu,

39
00:02:15,653 --> 00:02:20,857
he made a point of saying that he wasn't
arriving with demands and that he had come

40
00:02:20,907 --> 00:02:22,359
to work as a team,

41
00:02:22,409 --> 00:02:27,555
and few people noticed that this one word
would end up at the centre of everything

42
00:02:27,605 --> 00:02:30,962
that happened to Vinicius over
the next few months.

43
00:02:40,312 --> 00:02:41,464
A month later,

44
00:02:41,514 --> 00:02:43,102
at the Club World Cup,

45
00:02:43,152 --> 00:02:45,014
he explained what he meant:

46
00:02:45,064 --> 00:02:46,434
all eleven defend,

47
00:02:46,484 --> 00:02:47,636
no exceptions,

48
00:02:47,686 --> 00:02:50,149
and that included Mbappé and Vinicius,

49
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:55,065
who under Ancelotti had won two Champions
Leagues with almost total freedom on the

50
00:02:55,115 --> 00:02:55,775
left,

51
00:02:55,825 --> 00:03:00,254
and who six months earlier had been named
FIFA's best player in the world.

52
00:03:00,604 --> 00:03:04,286
It was a hard request to swallow at
that point in his career,

53
00:03:04,336 --> 00:03:07,586
and the first sign of it came
in the October Clásico.

54
00:03:07,936 --> 00:03:10,575
On the twenty-sixth of October 2025,

55
00:03:10,625 --> 00:03:14,182
Real Madrid beat Barcelona
two-one at the Bernabéu,

56
00:03:14,232 --> 00:03:18,154
and in the seventy-second minute
Xabi takes Vinicius off.

57
00:03:18,204 --> 00:03:21,455
He walks straight down the
tunnel complaining,

58
00:03:21,505 --> 00:03:25,856
and three days later he posts an
apology that mentions the fans,

59
00:03:25,906 --> 00:03:29,462
his teammates and the
president, but not the coach.

60
00:03:29,812 --> 00:03:31,277
Keep that minute in mind,

61
00:03:31,327 --> 00:03:32,195
seventy-two,

62
00:03:32,245 --> 00:03:34,490
because it comes back later in this story.

63
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,914
On the fourth of January 2026,

64
00:03:36,964 --> 00:03:38,144
against Betis,

65
00:03:38,194 --> 00:03:42,225
the cameras catch Xabi shouting at
Vinicius not to stop pressing,

66
00:03:42,275 --> 00:03:46,418
and Vinicius answering that his
teammates should pass him the ball,

67
00:03:46,468 --> 00:03:48,375
and when he is substituted,

68
00:03:48,425 --> 00:03:50,891
the Bernabéu whistles its own player.

69
00:03:50,941 --> 00:03:52,288
A few days later,

70
00:03:52,338 --> 00:03:53,910
before the Super Cup,

71
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,307
Xabi defends him,

72
00:03:55,357 --> 00:03:58,382
but makes it clear the
demand isn't going away.

73
00:04:16,332 --> 00:04:17,481
A week later,

74
00:04:17,531 --> 00:04:20,392
Real lose the Super Cup
final to Barcelona,

75
00:04:20,442 --> 00:04:24,159
and on the twelfth of January Xabi
Alonso leaves the club,

76
00:04:24,209 --> 00:04:26,842
seven and a half months after arriving.

77
00:04:27,192 --> 00:04:28,937
According to The Athletic,

78
00:04:28,987 --> 00:04:33,531
Vinicius had been holding back on his
contract renewal precisely to see whether

79
00:04:33,581 --> 00:04:34,798
Xabi would stay,

80
00:04:34,848 --> 00:04:36,171
and with his exit,

81
00:04:36,221 --> 00:04:40,870
the first attempt to turn Vinicius into a
different kind of player ended with the

82
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,246
coach leaving and the player staying.

83
00:04:43,596 --> 00:04:48,103
The second would come from a manager who had
just proved in England that this way

84
00:04:48,153 --> 00:04:49,690
of playing wins titles.

85
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,632
In May 2026,

86
00:04:53,682 --> 00:04:59,099
Mikel Arteta's Arsenal are champions of
England for the first time in twenty-two

87
00:04:59,149 --> 00:04:59,969
years,

88
00:05:00,019 --> 00:05:02,702
with the best defence in the league,

89
00:05:02,752 --> 00:05:06,181
twenty-six goals conceded in
thirty-eight games,

90
00:05:06,231 --> 00:05:11,710
and Arteta has always explained what he asks
of his players in very simple terms.

91
00:05:17,460 --> 00:05:18,649
In Madrid,

92
00:05:18,699 --> 00:05:22,434
Real bring in José Mourinho
to replace Arbeloa,

93
00:05:22,484 --> 00:05:27,802
and Vinicius reaches the summer with his
contract running out in 2027.

94
00:05:28,152 --> 00:05:29,242
That is when,

95
00:05:29,292 --> 00:05:30,544
according to AS,

96
00:05:30,594 --> 00:05:33,095
Arteta personally takes over the talks,

97
00:05:33,145 --> 00:05:37,654
walks Vinicius through Arsenal's project
and promises he would be the team's

98
00:05:37,704 --> 00:05:39,282
reference on the left,

99
00:05:39,332 --> 00:05:40,910
in Martinelli's place,

100
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:45,686
while Real Madrid let it be known that they
won't accept less than a hundred and

101
00:05:45,736 --> 00:05:47,206
fifty million euros.

102
00:05:47,556 --> 00:05:50,340
For the second time in less than a year,

103
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:54,946
someone was offering Vinicius the chance
to become a different player,

104
00:05:54,996 --> 00:05:58,134
this time at a champion club
in a new country,

105
00:05:58,184 --> 00:06:01,145
and the answer came on the
sixth of August,

106
00:06:01,195 --> 00:06:04,156
when Real announced his
renewal until 2032,

107
00:06:04,206 --> 00:06:07,522
five days after that smile
from Arteta in Girona.

108
00:06:07,872 --> 00:06:09,267
That same summer,

109
00:06:09,317 --> 00:06:14,122
Real Madrid pay Leipzig around a hundred
and twenty-five million euros for a

110
00:06:14,172 --> 00:06:17,532
nineteen-year-old left winger
from the Ivory Coast,

111
00:06:17,582 --> 00:06:18,746
Yan Diomande,

112
00:06:18,796 --> 00:06:22,734
and when Mourinho is asked whether
he requested that signing,

113
00:06:22,784 --> 00:06:24,526
he doesn't dress it up.

114
00:06:29,876 --> 00:06:31,873
And if you're enjoying this story,

115
00:06:31,923 --> 00:06:33,580
take a second to subscribe,

116
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:36,066
because this is where it
starts to resolve.

117
00:06:38,816 --> 00:06:40,444
At the end of August,

118
00:06:40,494 --> 00:06:43,107
Mourinho starts by defending Vinicius,

119
00:06:43,157 --> 00:06:46,058
saying he is unfairly
targeted in stadiums,

120
00:06:46,108 --> 00:06:50,862
but on the same day he makes a request
that another coach had already made.

121
00:07:08,212 --> 00:07:09,971
On the tenth of October,

122
00:07:10,021 --> 00:07:11,496
against Villarreal,

123
00:07:11,546 --> 00:07:13,588
Vinicius starts on the bench,

124
00:07:13,638 --> 00:07:16,526
comes on in the second half
and even scores,

125
00:07:16,576 --> 00:07:18,957
but VAR rules the goal out because,

126
00:07:19,007 --> 00:07:22,178
in the same move, he pulled
Nathan Saliba's hair.

127
00:07:22,528 --> 00:07:25,711
The red card comes at around
seventy-two minutes,

128
00:07:25,761 --> 00:07:30,815
almost the same point on the clock at which he
had walked off angry in the Clásico

129
00:07:30,865 --> 00:07:32,119
a year earlier,

130
00:07:32,169 --> 00:07:37,053
and the goal that wins the game for Real
that night is Diomande's first for the

131
00:07:37,103 --> 00:07:37,790
club.

132
00:07:38,140 --> 00:07:40,588
Four days later comes a four-game ban,

133
00:07:40,638 --> 00:07:44,714
two games for the hair pull and two for
his protests at the referee.

134
00:07:45,064 --> 00:07:47,221
On the eve of the Sevilla game,

135
00:07:47,271 --> 00:07:52,088
Mourinho talks about him in a way that few
people expected to hear from a Real

136
00:07:52,138 --> 00:07:53,390
Madrid manager.

137
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:28,547
He was talking about the racist abuse that
Vinicius has heard in Spanish stadiums

138
00:08:28,597 --> 00:08:29,530
for years,

139
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:31,876
and on that he is completely right,

140
00:08:31,926 --> 00:08:35,697
but it is hard to hear that sentence
without remembering that,

141
00:08:35,747 --> 00:08:37,170
two months earlier,

142
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:40,827
a club in another country had made
exactly that invitation,

143
00:08:40,877 --> 00:08:43,010
and that Vinicius chose to stay.

144
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,968
Ancelotti protected Vinicius for years,

145
00:08:46,018 --> 00:08:50,776
and the whole club did the same when it
stayed away from the 2024 Ballon d'Or

146
00:08:50,826 --> 00:08:51,738
ceremony,

147
00:08:51,788 --> 00:08:55,075
but Mourinho protects and
demands at the same time,

148
00:08:55,125 --> 00:08:56,715
and three days later,

149
00:08:56,765 --> 00:08:58,921
before a Champions League game,

150
00:08:58,971 --> 00:09:02,259
when he was asked whether
Vinicius was untouchable,

151
00:09:02,309 --> 00:09:06,614
he answered that the only untouchable
thing at the club is the badge.

152
00:09:06,964 --> 00:09:09,072
On the twenty-fifth of October,

153
00:09:09,122 --> 00:09:13,997
Real Madrid go to the Camp Nou and win the
Clásico two-one while Vinicius watches

154
00:09:14,047 --> 00:09:15,381
from the outside,

155
00:09:15,431 --> 00:09:20,251
and a week later Arsenal beat Liverpool at
Anfield for the first time since 2012

156
00:09:20,301 --> 00:09:23,184
and go back to the top of
the Premier League,

157
00:09:23,234 --> 00:09:28,164
which means the two clubs that fought over
Vinicius in the summer spent that month

158
00:09:28,214 --> 00:09:29,714
winning without him.

159
00:09:32,464 --> 00:09:33,700
During the ban,

160
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:35,488
Real won all four games,

161
00:09:35,538 --> 00:09:37,333
four-one against Sevilla,

162
00:09:37,383 --> 00:09:39,233
two-one against Barcelona,

163
00:09:39,283 --> 00:09:42,810
three-nil against Racing and
three-nil against Valencia,

164
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:45,381
scoring twelve and conceding just two,

165
00:09:45,431 --> 00:09:47,002
and on the left wing,

166
00:09:47,052 --> 00:09:48,567
in Vinicius's place,

167
00:09:48,617 --> 00:09:49,908
played Diomande,

168
00:09:49,958 --> 00:09:53,150
who scored against Villarreal,
Sevilla and Racing.

169
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:56,653
When Mourinho explained what
he had seen in him,

170
00:09:56,703 --> 00:09:58,541
he talked about pace and,

171
00:09:58,591 --> 00:09:59,571
above all,

172
00:09:59,621 --> 00:10:01,230
about defensive work,

173
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:06,435
which is exactly what Xabi Alonso was
demanding from Vinicius in that January press

174
00:10:06,485 --> 00:10:08,838
conference that opened this video.

175
00:10:08,888 --> 00:10:12,842
And when Diomande arrived, he said
this about his new manager.

176
00:10:18,792 --> 00:10:23,807
And when Mourinho needed a comparison to
explain what that kid could still become,

177
00:10:23,857 --> 00:10:25,270
he chose Vinicius.

178
00:10:35,420 --> 00:10:36,048
Now,

179
00:10:36,098 --> 00:10:37,799
to be fair to Vinicius,

180
00:10:37,849 --> 00:10:42,939
it is worth remembering that he is racially
abused in stadium after stadium through

181
00:10:42,989 --> 00:10:44,521
no fault of his own,

182
00:10:44,571 --> 00:10:47,798
that he has scored in two
Champions League finals,

183
00:10:47,848 --> 00:10:52,938
and that four games from a nineteen-year-old
are far too few for any final verdict.

184
00:10:53,288 --> 00:10:58,358
What all these coaches asked of him has to do
with what he does when the opponent

185
00:10:58,408 --> 00:10:59,566
has the ball,

186
00:10:59,616 --> 00:11:04,168
and that is what Diomande delivered in
the month he played in his place.

187
00:11:04,218 --> 00:11:07,734
Now that the ban is over,
Vinicius is back in La Liga.

188
00:11:08,084 --> 00:11:09,883
If you've made it this far,

189
00:11:09,933 --> 00:11:14,689
tell me in the comments whether you think
Vinicius was right to stay at Real Madrid

190
00:11:14,739 --> 00:11:17,119
or should have taken the Arsenal move,

191
00:11:17,169 --> 00:11:20,394
and subscribe to follow what
happens to him from here.

192
00:11:20,744 --> 00:11:25,932
Xabi Alonso asked Vinicius to commit without
the ball and was sacked a week later,

193
00:11:25,982 --> 00:11:30,938
Arteta offered him a champion team where
that is the rule and was turned down,

194
00:11:30,988 --> 00:11:33,382
and in the month Vinicius was out,

195
00:11:33,432 --> 00:11:37,806
Real won every game with a kid who does
exactly what Xabi asked for.

196
00:11:38,156 --> 00:11:39,641
That day in Girona,

197
00:11:39,691 --> 00:11:42,768
when Arteta was asked when
Vinicius was coming,

198
00:11:42,818 --> 00:11:45,668
he smiled and walked out
without answering,

199
00:11:45,718 --> 00:11:50,784
and the answer that matters now is the one
Vinicius himself will give on the pitch

200
00:11:50,834 --> 00:11:51,978
from here on:

201
00:11:52,028 --> 00:11:56,754
whether there is still time to become the
player Xabi and Arteta saw in him.
